  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "4.0.0: Major bump for the removed public DbEngine.ReadWriteLock plus the new transaction/file contracts. A failed statement aborts the transaction (TransactionAborted; Discard to reuse); a failed commit keeps dirty pages for retry; cross-thread Dispose is safe; new readers see the latest commit; empty commits no longer create the .log; a failed log replay keeps it. Opening validates the header (LumDBS signature, page format 1.3.9); other formats are rejected. Pool cap 32 with TooManyOpenTransactions and TransactionPoolWaitMilliseconds. Serializable transactions throw NotSupportedException. Page format stays 1.3.9.",
